# Backend

Read `.cursor/skills/tech-stack/SKILL.md`, `.cursor/skills/ddd-architecture/SKILL.md`, `.cursor/skills/senior-backend/SKILL.md`, and `.cursor/skills/senior-cybersecurity/SKILL.md` before editing APIs or schema.

- Put code in a bounded context package (`freight/`, `crm/`, …), not a global `models/` folder.
- Thin FastAPI routers. Invariants live on the aggregate. One aggregate per transaction.
- Authorize every object id on the server. Deny by default.
- Resource URLs use nouns: `/shipments`, not `/create-shipment`.
- Secrets only from environment variables. Never commit `.env`.
